# Normalise line endings in the repo, check out native on each platform.
# This project is authored on Windows but the venv launcher, the server and the
# engines all have to run on Linux CI and macOS too; without this, every
# checkout on another platform shows every file as modified.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.task binary
*.wasm binary
*.parquet binary
